# Cases whose golden comes from a fork commit, one name per line, each with
# the change of behaviour it judges. Every case in cases.list not named here
# judges behaviour the fork preserves, and its golden comes from upstream
# v4.8.0. make-golden.sh writes one set or the other, chosen by REF.
#
# ADR-102 step 1 (aaronsb/kmscon): colon sub-parameters, underline styles,
# underline colour (SGR 58/59) and strike-through (SGR 9/29).
sgr-basic                   # SGR 9 sets strike
sgr-underline-extended      # 4:x styles and 58 colours apply; 4;58;5;196 no longer blinks
# Added with the change; upstream discards or misreads each:
sgr-color-forms-fg          # colon colour forms for 38
sgr-color-forms-bg          # colon colour forms for 48
sgr-color-forms-ul          # SGR 58 in every colour form
sgr-underline-styles        # 4:0-4:5, unknown style, 21, 24
sgr-strike                  # 9 and 29
sgr-underline-color-reset   # 59, 24 and SGR 0 against the underline colour
sgr-subparam-unknown        # unknown sub-parameters skipped alone
sgr-58-semicolon-no-blink   # 58 consumes its 5
sgr-subparam-overflow       # sub-parameters past eight dropped
sgr-color-colon-out-of-range  # colon index or component above 255 rejected
sgr-color-semicolon-subparams # semicolon form with sub-parameters consumes nothing
#
# ADR-102 step 3: grapheme clusters, width methods, mode 2027.
combining                   # combining marks join their base cell
